 environment compared with the past two years,", "a": "said Cary Grace, AMN President and Chief Executive Officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1142750/000095014225000463/eh250593369_ex9901.htm"}, {"d": "2024-11-07", "n": 4.4, "z": 0.13, "rz": -1.11, "earn": true, "q": "Our company performed well in difficult competitive conditions to surpass revenue and earnings expectations in the third quarter of 2024,", "a": "said Cary Grace, President and Chief Executive Officer of AMN Healthcare", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1142750/000095014224002692/eh240554258_ex9901.htm"}], "now": {"d": "2026-11-05", "z": 1.15, "mood": "up"}, "say_do": {"mood": "up", "acts": "none", "clash": false, "agree": false}}, "score": {"value": 44, "verdict": {"it": "Leggermente ribassista", "en": "Mildly bearish"}, "confidence": "Media", "covered_pct": 80, "missing": ["guid"], "subs": [{"id": "insider", "name": {"it": "Insider", "en": "Insiders"}, "w": 35, "v": 50, "why": [{"it": "Nessun acquisto discrezionale negli ultimi 90 giorni.", "en": "No discretionary purchase in the last 90 days."}, {"it": "Flusso netto pesato sullo storico: +0.00 M$.", "en": "Net flow weighted by track record: +0.00 M$."}, {"it": "6 operazioni escluse perché non informative (piani 10b5-1, ritenute fiscali, esercizi e assegnazioni).", "en": "6 transactions excluded as uninformative (10b5-1 plans, tax withholding, exercises and awards)."}], "coverage": "Alta"}, {"id": "guid", "name": {"it": "Guidance e tono", "en": "Guidance and tone"}, "w": 20, "v": null, "why": [{"it": "Serve l'export delle trascrizioni delle call.", "en": "Needs the export of the earnings-call transcripts."}], "coverage": "Assente"}, {"id": "market", "name": {"it": "Mercato", "en": "Market"}, "w": 15, "v": 10, "why": [{"it": "Short interest a 4.0 milioni di azioni, +44.9% rispetto alla mediana dell'ultimo anno (2.8 milioni).", "en": "Short interest at 4.0 million shares, +44.9% against the median of the last year (